usage stats in a small always-available desktop window.

Two GUI backends, one file: GTK3 on Linux, Tkinter on Windows. Everything
above the backend split — stats, quota polling, Clawd, config — is shared, so
the two builds can never drift apart in what they report.

Modes: expanded (full stats + walking Clawd) and mini (small cube with
remaining-budget meters + Clawd in the corner).

CLI: --json prints the computed stats and exits (for testing/scripting).
"""
